    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cWill you accept your fate, or forge a new destiny?\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery of <strong>MANA</strong> has revolutionised technology. RoboCorp harnessed its power and abundance to fuel their line of intelligent robots, bringing peace to the world. But everything comes at a price, and the public is yet to learn the cost of progress...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Pascal in this unforgettable story as you unravel the mystery behind <strong>MANA</strong> technology, RoboCorp, and a mysterious figure who claims to be from the future. Do you have what it takes to change the past?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Minigame Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based combat where every attack is a minigame! Whether that be dodging projectiles, pressing buttons in time with music, or mashing inputs, minigames provide a fresh twist on the classic turn-based RPG formula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/b9da326bba006805c78aa1cd83a9bf8d.poster.avif?t=1752182185\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/b9da326bba006805c78aa1cd83a9bf8d.webm?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/b9da326bba006805c78aa1cd83a9bf8d.mp4?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vibrant Solarpunk World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a futuristic setting fuelled by <strong>MANA</strong>. Four unique areas await, including peaceful villages, lush forests, and bustling urban cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/042e423c37e523487d6333cbdfea245f.poster.avif?t=1752182185\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/042e423c37e523487d6333cbdfea245f.webm?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/042e423c37e523487d6333cbdfea245f.mp4?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn about the future \u2192 unlock new attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find Memory Crystals throughout your journey, which will uncover the secrets Pascal seeks. Use those memories to unlock combat modifiers and brand new attacks! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/59df70792374ba0d55eaffa51667925c.poster.avif?t=1752182185\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/59df70792374ba0d55eaffa51667925c.webm?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/59df70792374ba0d55eaffa51667925c.mp4?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cWill you accept your fate, or forge a new destiny?\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The discovery of <strong>MANA</strong> has revolutionised technology. RoboCorp harnessed its power and abundance to fuel their line of intelligent robots, bringing peace to the world. But everything comes at a price, and the public is yet to learn the cost of progress...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Pascal in this unforgettable story as you unravel the mystery behind <strong>MANA</strong> technology, RoboCorp, and a mysterious figure who claims to be from the future. Do you have what it takes to change the past?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Minigame Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in turn-based combat where every attack is a minigame! Whether that be dodging projectiles, pressing buttons in time with music, or mashing inputs, minigames provide a fresh twist on the classic turn-based RPG formula.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/b9da326bba006805c78aa1cd83a9bf8d.poster.avif?t=1752182185\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/b9da326bba006805c78aa1cd83a9bf8d.webm?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/b9da326bba006805c78aa1cd83a9bf8d.mp4?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vibrant Solarpunk World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a futuristic setting fuelled by <strong>MANA</strong>. Four unique areas await, including peaceful villages, lush forests, and bustling urban cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/042e423c37e523487d6333cbdfea245f.poster.avif?t=1752182185\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/042e423c37e523487d6333cbdfea245f.webm?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/042e423c37e523487d6333cbdfea245f.mp4?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn about the future \u2192 unlock new attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find Memory Crystals throughout your journey, which will uncover the secrets Pascal seeks. Use those memories to unlock combat modifiers and brand new attacks! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/59df70792374ba0d55eaffa51667925c.poster.avif?t=1752182185\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/59df70792374ba0d55eaffa51667925c.webm?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224780/extras/59df70792374ba0d55eaffa51667925c.mp4?t=1752182185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an epic journey to change the past in this 2.5D adventure RPG! Conquer turn-based minigame battles to unravel a story of fate and self-discovery. Will you accept your fate, or forge a new destiny?",
